This project uses claude-ds.

- UI / `.tsx` work → read `design-system/CLAUDE.md` AND grep `design-system/manifest.json` first
- No Bash mutation of `.tsx` or `design-system/**` (no heredoc, no `sed -i`, no `awk` in-place — use Write/Edit/MultiEdit)
- Hook scripts in `.claude/hooks/` enforce the contracts on every Edit/Write
- Blocking failures append to `design-system/failure-log.md` via `.claude/hooks/lib/log-failure.sh`
- Precedence on conflict: hooks > contracts > principles > skills
